{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux从PID文件启动进程。对应需求：执行。官方：Process Started from Process ID (PID) File。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux从PID文件启动进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux从PID文件启动进程\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机或容器内执行代码\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.sandflysecurity.com/blog/linux-file-masquerading-and-malicious-pids-sandfly-1-2-6-update/","https://twitter.com/GossiTheDog/status/1522964028284411907","https://exatrack.com/public/Tricephalic_Hellkeeper.pdf","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/a-peek-behind-the-bpfdoor"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"3688577a-d196-11ec-90b0-f661ea17fbce","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and user.id == \"0\" and\n  process.executable regex~ \"\"\"/var/run/\\w+\\.(pid|lock|reboot)\"\"\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1036.005","name":"Match Legitimate Resource Name or Location","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/005/"},{"id":"T1036.008","name":"Masquerade File Type","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/008/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":116,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
